Today @arjunmathur_ and I are introducing Dream.

We’re announcing $17M in seed funding from @a16z , @svangel , @xyz_vc , and @ziggcap.

@dreamhq is developing a new class of models trained to reason about physical space: its geometry, its constraints, and the relationships between objects and the spaces that contain them. With these models, AI can make a real impact in the $13 trillion architecture, engineering, and construction (AEC) industry for the first time.
